Z||000047||bHooper||08-27-2001||07:53 AM||||i wanted to let everyone know, that on friday afternoon, we had to put Byng down.  We tried everything that we could do, but apparently the fluid ws building up in her stomach, as well as chest... so in the end we couldn't keep her comfortable.<P>it was a tough decision, but it was the right one... you could see in her eyes that she wasn't herself.  the last couple of nights, she couldn't sleep, without smothering.<P>i allready miss my puppy.... however, i do feel that there is a big weight off of my sholder now.<P>i wanted to thank everyone for their support and addvice throught this whole ordeal.<P>hoop||||reg||1
